[8.0, "o", "plant-waterer is read-only. Answer each limit first with openhal file confirm ~/.openhal/devices/plant-waterer.hal.yaml\r\nChange a limit with openhal limits set desk-lamp.brightness --max \"60 %\", or pick each step with openhal limits set\r\n"]
